      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart D \u2014 Design And Construction",
      "title_at_revision": "Reserve energy absorption drop tests",
      "text": "(a) If compliance with the reserve energy absorption requirements in CS 23.723 (b) is shown by free drop tests, the drop height may not be less than 1\u00b744 times that specified in CS 23.725.\n(b) If the effect of wing lift is provided for, the units must be dropped with an effective mass equal to \u239b h \u239e , when the symbols M_{e} = M \u239c \u239f \u239d h + d \u23a0 and other details are the same as in CS 23.725.",
